; An explicit cost on a virtual posting disables the implicit exchange
; of its own group alone: the (Memo) group balances at its cost, while
; the real group's $100 and -80 EUR still infer their exchange and
; balance (since #3317 each balancing group is priced on its own).
; Before #3317 an explicit cost on any posting disabled the implicit
; exchange of Phase 3 for the whole transaction, and the transaction
; was rejected.

2024/01/01 Virtual cost plus a real exchange
    Assets:A    $100
    Assets:B    -80 EUR
    (Memo)      1 XYZ @ $1

test bal
                $100
             -80 EUR  Assets
                $100    A
             -80 EUR    B
               1 XYZ  Memo
--------------------
                $100
             -80 EUR
               1 XYZ
end test
